window.products.push({"id":927106,"name":"12.5\" Green Ceramic Vase for Home Decor Large Decorative Vase Boho Pottery Bud Vase for Flowers Rustic Farmhouse Tall Single Flower Vase for Centerpie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AIAoZMj3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Minimalist Vase】:This modern vase with handle has a classical vase shape, with superb glazing process and firing at high temperature, it has a glazed finish and ice cracked effect on its upper surface, the bottom of this tall vase is designed a vintage unglazed terracotta effect and has irregular spots on its surface, which makes it exquisite and special, this decorative vase will add artistic flavor to your interior decoration and show your impeccable taste 【Premium Quality Pottery Vase 】: Made from high quality ceramic, the bud vases for flowers are hard to be out of shape, fade or paint off.We design a handle to carry this vintage flower vase more easily.The durable, charm, long lasting single flower vase will brighten up your home and keep your décor looking fresh(（flowers are NOT included） 【Good Size】: The dimension of the decorative vase for home decor is 5\"x12.5\" (D&H)with 2.5\" opening, you can fill dried flowers, pampas grass, dried eucalyptus, artificial flowers, plant, stems, branches, cotton, wheat and so on.( As slight water seepage will occur if the pampas grass vases hold water for a long time, these pottery jug vases are not recommend for fresh flower or holding water) 【Multi-Purpose Vases for Decor】: These green decor vases are not only can be use as a flowers vase for flowers arrangement, but also you can place it stand alone as a decorative piece.This vases for centerpieces will fit in with different styles, such as modern ,farmhouse, rustic, boho, etc, it is also an ideal choice for your flower arrangement or ceramic lovers/family/friends/neighbors as a candlelight dinner/housewarming/birthday/celebration/wedding/anniversary/New Year/ Christmas gift 【Perfect Decor】: You can put your favorite filler into these ceramic vase for home decor, this vase for flowers is perfect choice to place it on home, office, shop, bar, coffee table, dinning table centerpiece, bookshelf, fireplace, yard, bedroom, kitchen, bedroom, living room,meeting room, etc","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AIAoZMj3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oairse","source_asin":"B095JY4Y1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095JY4Y1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095JY4Y1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
