window.products.push({"id":927126,"name":"Handmade Italian Round, Glass Copper Plate, Woven Design Copper Serving Plate | “Vetro Oro” Inspired Large Glass Plate, Decorative Glass Serving Tray ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mWsZSWirL._AC_.jpg","description":"“VETRO ORO” 14.75” SERVING PLATTER: Don't just set the table, set it apart with our handmade “Vetro Oro” copper serving plate by Modigliani. This beautiful, handcrafted decorative coffee table dish is inspired by Vetro Oro which means “gold glass” in Italian. Our round glass serving plate are hand painted by Italian artisans and make the perfect addition to any modern inspired home décor or dinnerware set. UNIQUE, ITALIAN DESIGN: Show off your unique style & taste with these one-of-a-kind glassware serving dishes which are handcrafted by our skilled artisans. This luxurious copper colored platter is actually made entirely from glass from an ancient Itlaian tradition. This sophisticated round serving platter is perfect for displaying on a coffee table or using on special occasions to serve your guests! HANDMADE BY ITALIAN ARTISTS: Each of our large serving plates and serving ware are traditionally hand crafted by our skilled artisans in Italy. The Modigliani, “Vetro Oro” glassware collection helps you bring the taste of Italian art into your home. Please note, the item you receive will not be the exactly as pictured, but nearly identical. Each large serving platter is an original work of art, uniquely hand-made. PREMIUM DINNERWARE COLLECTIONS: Our “Vetro Oro” decorative plates are available in two designs, copper and gold, and are just one of our many dinnerware collections! These serving plates also pair nicely with our “Tivoli” glass wine tumblers. Click the Modigliani storefront to see our entire range of products! SUPPORT TRADITION: Modigliani Italian dinnerware strongly supports the tradition of passing down art from past four generation. All set pieces in this dinnerware collection were made by Italian artists that have learned classic ways of creating beautiful, functional art. Collect a piece of Italy and indulge your eyes with a natural dinnerware set that is made to last and support the timeless tradition of handmade glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mWsZSWirL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modigliani","source_asin":"B00Y9GWB8U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y9GWB8U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y9GWB8U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
