window.products.push({"id":927137,"name":"Wallniture Toledo Wood Floating Shelves for Wall Storage, Floating Bookshelf Set of 3, 24\"x6\" Rustic Wall Shelves for Living Room, Bedroom, Kitchen, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NwRu86ydL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorative Shelves for Wall: With Toledo wall book shelves for living room decor, upgrade your wall decorations for living room while maximizng your small space! Our wall shelf set is ideal to display and store everything from books to small home decorations like scculents, picture frames, and more Multifunctional: Wallniture wooden floating shelves wall mounted set of 3 is extremely versatile! Besides being perfect knick knack shelf and book display shelf for living room wall decor, Toledo rustic shelves for wall can be used as wall shelves for bedroom decor, bathroom shelves over the toilet storage, or kitchen organization and storage shelves Sturdy Construction: Toledo 24\"x6\" on-budget wall mounted shelves are longer, wider and sturdier than others! Crafted from high-quality metal brackets and solid paulownia wood boards , Wallniture rustic wood shelves will last you years to come. Store up to 40lbs without any hassle Simple Installation: Wallniture Toledo floating wall shelves for storage come with all necessary hardware. Just follow the easy instructions and use the included hardware, your decorative living room shelves will be ready to use in a few minute Perfect Design: Wallniture wall book shelf set of 3 has designed to match seamlessly with every interior design and style! Utilize Toledo hanging shelves for wall to complete your modern home decor, rustic decor, farmhouse decor, or boho decor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NwRu86ydL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallniture","source_asin":"B09MR1TS7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MR1TS7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MR1TS7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":927138,"name":"O-Lifbirch Wood Stove Fan Heat Powered, 6-Blade Non Electric fireplace with Magnetic Thermometer，wood accessories for Log Burner/Pellet/Burning/Wood B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514DBF7L9mL._AC_.jpg","description":"Does the stove fan have batteries? No. The stove fan is effectively an engine that uses heat as an energy source to make it run. The heat differential between the base of the unit and the top of the fan drives the motor, which in turn drives the blades around, while the cooling fans at the rear help keep the top of the fan at a much lower temperature, making sure the fan spins maintains constant revolutions.The little motor in the fan is a thermoelectric motor – a really simple device whereby two semi-conductors at different temperatures can create a voltage between them. This electricity isn’t huge, but it is just enough to drive the blades of the fan around. Does it work on all stoves? The stove fire fan will only work on stoves that achieve a certain minimum temperature(185℉/85C). This is because the base of the unit needs to get up to temperature before the temperature differential between the top of the device and the bottom is high enough to make the blades turn. What is the best position for the fan? The key thing to note when placing your fan is that it needs space behind it. This is because the fan draws cooler air from behind the fan to help power it. If you block the rear of the fan, by setting it up against the wall or the flue, you are going to get an inefficient system. Also try and put it towards the rear of the stove (allowing about 10 cm/4 inch of space behind the fan), so that the fan pushes the warm air out into the room. Can the stove fan get too hot? Yes. If the fan gets too hot it can overheat and damage the motor. To prevent this you can use the stove thermometer (include in the package) to check on the temperature and know when it is getting too hot for your fan(700℉/400 C).Or you can check the thermometer sticker on the top of the stove(when number 131℉/55 C shows). If it gets too hot, you can try moving it to a cooler part of the stove or removing it completely. Specification: Material: Anodized aluminum Noise<45db Item weight: 1.66 pounds Overall Size: 5.91 x 3.94 x 3.15 inches Air Flow: 150180CFM Operating temperature:85C - 350C(185F - 660F) Package Include: 1* Wood stove fan 1* Magnetic Thermometer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514DBF7L9mL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O-Lifbirch","source_asin":"B0BDGBZWN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDGBZWN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDGBZWN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
