window.products.push({"id":927153,"name":"bathivy Blender, High Speed Blender 1300W, Professional Countertop Blender Multi-function with LED Screen, Blender for Puree, Shakes and Smoothies, 6 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":108.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617-Wbxs2FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐【Strong Blades & Powerful Motor, Consistently Smooth Blending】High speed blender is equipped with powerful blades and a high-performance motor, ensuring that it can blend various ingredients with ease and extract nutrition in a nartural way. 8-tip strong stainless steel blades combined with a powerful 1300W motor can quickly and easily crush ingredients, even ice, for achieving consistently smooth blending results. Experience the perfect blend of taste and nutrition with the blender. ⭐【6 Pre-set Programs fot Varible Recipes, Versatile Efficient Blender】The blender with 6 smart programs is designed to handle different types of recipes and achieved a maximum versatility. With its versatile functionality, it is easy to blend anything from smoothies and shakes to ice cream and nut milk. The blender come with multiple blending speeds, blending time, and even pulse functions, allowing users to customize their blending experience to achieve the perfect results for any recipe. ⭐【Precision Digital Display, Intuitive Control & Effortless Operation】The multi-function blender features a precision digital display that provides accurate information about mode, blending time and speed. It allowing users to customize blending settings to achieve the perfect results. The blender's effortless operation allows you to blend ingredients to perfection. The intuitive controls and clear display make it simple to create smoothies and shakes that are both delicious and nutritious. ⭐【High Capacity Professional Blender, for Hosting and Entertaining】2L large capacity blender is a powerful blending machine that is designed to handle large quantities of ingredients at once. It's ideal for kitchens where families or individuals frequently prepare large meals. The countertop blender allowing for the preparation of large batches foods. It can handle tough and fibrous ingredients such as ice, nuts, and leafy greens, ensuring that all ingredients are blended evenly and smoothly. ⭐【Sleek & Simple Outlook, Reliable Quality, Superior Safety Design】Professional blender boasts a sleek and simple design that fits seamlessly into any kitchen decor. It is designed for efficiency, speed, and durability, making them ideal for home and busy commercial environments. Additionally, the power blender is equipped with a safety lock, providing peace of mind while you blend your favorite recipes. It can only be operated normally when the safety lock is in the correct position.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617-Wbxs2FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bathivy","source_asin":"B0BF5GDYKH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF5GDYKH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF5GDYKH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
