window.products.push({"id":927157,"name":"INSE Corded Vacuum Cleaner, 18000Pa Corded Stick Vacuum Cleaner, 600W Powerful Motor Corded Floor Vacuum Cleaner - French","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tyEzUA+hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Technical specifications: Motor Power: 600W Max Power Suction:18 Kpa Vacuum Weight: 3.3 lbs Dust Collection: bagless Dust cup: 1 liter Working Mode: Stick Vacuum Cleaner & Handheld Vacuum Cleaner Frequently Asked Questions and Answers The suction of the vacuum cleaner reduced? 1. The filter is too dirty, resulting in blockage; please wash with water and reinstall after air-dry. 2. The filter has been used for too long and is not clean. It needs to be replaced every 3-6 months according to using frequency. 3. Please check if any port is clogged or the dust cup is full (over-max-mark). 4. Make sure every connection between the components is tight especially the bottom cover of the dust cup. Sudden shutdown during use.How to deal with it? I5 corded vacuum is more powerful than most vacuum cleaner of its size. It is equipped with a strong motor so that it can provide a decent suction. It's normal that the motor part's temperature is higher than other parts. 1. If the vacuum cleaner is blocked it will lead to shut down because of overheating protection. Please check and clean any blockages & wait for about 30 minutes until the cleaner is cool down then try again. 2. If the machine can not be turned on again, please contact INSE customer to get support. If you need replacement parts and warranty, please contact INSE customer service directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tyEzUA+hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B09PHC1WPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PHC1WPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PHC1WPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
