window.products.push({"id":927167,"name":"Coolbird Tarot Tapestry 3 Pack(23\"×27\" | 60 * 70CM), The Sun The Moon The Star Tapestry Medieval Europe Divination Tapestry Wall Hanging Tapestries My","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yCw4AqOZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Sun The Moon The Star Tapestry - A Perfect Gift for all the age groups and it is perfect for both indoor and outdoor use ! Story on Tarot :  The tarot (first known as trionfiand later as tarocchi, tarock, and others) is a pack of playing cards, used from the mid-15th century in various parts of Europeto play games such as Italian tarocchiniand French tarot. In the late 18th century, it began to be used for divinationin the form of tarotology and cartomancy. These three natural phenomena (The Star-The Moon-The Sun) tell the truth of how people decide.  - The Star card make people think seriously and understand what's their true desires.  - The Moon card tells us that we must endure all kinds of anxiety that can not be determined, we still have to choose to walk the road ahead and bear the responsibility of various kinds of uneasiness and choice even if our decision is lonely.  - The Sun card herald the removal of all kinds of reasons that hinder the will, and making a determination to turn into the actual action and realize wishes. Tarot Tapestry Features : 【Mysterious Tarot Tapestry】Gorgeously illustrated tapestry print on polyester fabric for a worn, vintage look. Imported high quality raw material - 95% Polyster + 5% Spandex. Good feeling and good printing effect ! 【Package and Item Size】3 pcs tapestries inside the package, the size of each tapestry : Approx. 23\"×27\" | 60 * 70CM . 【Wide Usages】These arts can be used as a tapestry, bedspread, wall decoration, curtain, tablecloth, picnic mat, beach towel, scarf, shawl sunscreen and any other home decor idea, also a PERFECT GIFT FOR FAMILY OR FRIENDS. Warm Tips :  Please note that slight color difference should be acceptable due to the light and screen Hand wash in cold water. Machine-washable . Do not use chlorine bleach. Don't hesitate and ADD IT TO YOUR CART IMMEDIATELYL !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yCw4AqOZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coolbird","source_asin":"B0BXD9FGRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXD9FGRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXD9FGRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
