window.products.push({"id":927180,"name":"MJDFS Mistifi Olive Oil Sprayer/Mister for Cooking, Non-Aerosol Refillable Dispenser, 6oz Spray Bottle, FS603 KitchenRule","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hMwNyDSdL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Mistifi Oil Sprayer uses the most advanced international patented pre-compression spray technology, which can atomize your favorite cooking oil, bring an excellent cooking experience, and develop a low-oil diet life style. It’s an easy-to-use refillable dispenser without gas inside, and no complicated pressurization operation before spraying. The ergonomic arc design that combines aesthetics and functionality makes the sprayer easier to use. Even users with small hands can operate the sprayer conveniently with the perfect lever angle. The proper trigger force makes your fingers not feel tired even after a long-time use of the spray bottle. The dispense head is made of plastic (majority polyolefins (PP, PE) + (1) stainless steel spring) and the bottle material is PET, both are available with FDA certifications. The distance to the pan can be adjusted to control the covered area when spraying. Three spray modes by trigger techniques1. Half stroke Pull: for small areas use, it can effectively reduce the consumption of cooking oil 2. Full Stroke Pull: move the wrist when spraying fan-shaped mist, the oil can be evenly covered on the target area 3. Continuous Spray: spray your favorite oil on the large area effectively and evenly, ideal for BBQ While reducing the intake of oil, Mistifi Oil Sprayer also brings the joy of cooking, which is a kitchen artifact that many healthy dieters love.You can spray not only cooking oil, but also vinegar, soy sauce and cooking wine. PRECAUTIONS & TIPS1. PRIMING: pull the trigger completely 5-10 times to start spraying. Once primed, no need for re-priming2. DO NOT use it for liquids with particles3. Mister/Sprayer function depends on the oil density. If the oil density is too high, it might give you stream spray not mister4. If you have filled other liquids before, clean and dry the spray bottle before using the new liquid","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hMwNyDSdL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MJDFS","source_asin":"B088G2QDKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088G2QDKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088G2QDKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
