window.products.push({"id":927583,"name":"Besifona Ceramic Plates Set,7.5 Inch,Set of 6,The Dessert,Salad,Appetizer,Small Dinner etc Plate.Microwave,Oven,and Dishwasher Safe,Scratch Resistant,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EagDo+3vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The shape of Plates is a bit like a pumpkin LEAD FREE ALL NATURAL GLAZE: We know that lead is a poison, but what some of us don't know is that it is in a lot of ceramic glazes, since there is no US regulation for lead in adult products. Unlike other ceramic companies, our glazes are lead free, meaning you will never have to worry about lead leaching into your system and making you sick. Since our glaze is all-natural, it tends to change color depending on the lighting. The color may be a tad different from what you see on your screen. CRYSTALLIZED SCRATCH RESISTANT FORMULA: Our glaze is extra strong to prevent scratches from your knives and forks. Only we produce a crystallized glossy glaze that is strong enough to resist scratches under 1000 grams of pressure. Please note dark marks may occur due to finish on silverware. CERAMIC WITH 20% STRONGER PALADIN CLAY: Our clay was refined and fired with you in mind. Only we have Paladin Clay which is 20% stronger than the competitors, giving you a stronger and more durable ceramic plate. The shape was designed to stack and nestle nicely in your cupboard or shelves, help your food look even more delicious, and make you happy every day. Our kitchen plates are microwavable and also freezer, oven, and dishwasher safe. We provide a free refund or replacement for any defective products, anytime. Just let us know what happened. We offer daily customer service because you are important to us. Our objective is to help you hit pause, so we won’t settle for anything you don’t love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EagDo+3vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Besifona","source_asin":"B099ZJ86FP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099ZJ86FP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099ZJ86FP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
