window.products.push({"id":927787,"name":"CURTA Cutting Boards for Kitchen, 24\" x 18\" x 0.5\" White Color Coded Plastic Commercial Chopping Board Anti Slip Surface Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XjgwLwJiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"24 inch x 18 inch x 1/2 inch - The extra-large size can satisfy all your restaurant-level needs! This white poly cutting board is perfect for a wide variety of tasks and purposes, from slicing ingredients to meal preparation. Color-coded cutting boards - Compliant with the HACCP system (where different types of food are prepared with supplies of assigned colors), CURTA cutting boards will help identify, control, and monitor food safety in a systematic way. The white cutting board is reserved for dairy & bakery items. NSF-Listed - NSF-marked items mean the products meet strict public health protection standards. It can help you maintain a high level of food safety in your establishment and protect customers.NSF International reviews material choices, manufacturing processes, manufacturing facilities, and the final product to confirm that all phases of production meet their standards. Durable and Sanitary - CURTA cutting board is made with high-density polyethylene construction,features with anti-skid design, This cutting boards can hold in place while in use and avoid slipping and sliding. The surface will not compromise your knives' sharpness. Easy to clean - This size CANNOT withstand most home and commercial dishwasher, but is convenient to clean with soap/baking soda/bleach and water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XjgwLwJiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CURTA","source_asin":"B0BFQB7SX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFQB7SX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFQB7SX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":927788,"name":"Bodum 1932-17 Chambord Coffee Maker, 12 Cup, 1.5 Litre, Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mRsaRNzgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When Bodum took over a small clarinet factory in Normandy in 1982, it was not because of the fine orchestra clarinets they were producing but because of a relatively unknown coffee maker called the Chambord which they produced as well. The reason the French press coffee maker has become one of the most popular coffeemakers in the world is pure and simple, taste. The materials (glass and stainless steel) are completely taste-free so nothing comes between your ground coffee beans. This is exactly the reason why coffee tasters use this method to determine the quality of coffee beans. No paper filter not only means no waste but that the coffee bean's essential oils go directly to your cup, delivering the flavour that is lost on paper filters. Simplicity works best and is the reason why the Chambord's design has not changed a bit from its original drawing. Make taste, not waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mRsaRNzgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B0788BWQDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0788BWQDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0788BWQDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
