window.products.push({"id":927836,"name":"Valet 3 Chamber Wall Mounted Shampoo & Soap Dispenser with Integrated Hooks & 2 Bonus Sponge Loofahs – Holds Shampoo, Conditioner and Shower gels (Sat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QcTrUNRSL._AC_.jpg","description":"--PRODUCT DESCRIPTION-- Add your favorite shampoos, conditioners and shower gels to the Banera Valet 3 chamber shampoo and conditioner dispenser for shower wall using the easy-fill 11oz containers. The liquid soap dispenser is the perfect solution to de-clutter your shower combining style, function, practicality, and affordability. The wall mount liquid soap dispenser is the perfect addition to bathrooms, kitchens, hotels, offices, restaurants and more. The integrated hooks are perfect for hanging loofahs, scrubs and razors. Follow the easy instructions to either wall mount by no-tool silicone or screw mount. Note: It is recommended not to use any liquid with microbeads or grit. This could cause the dispenser to clog. --FEATURES & BENEFITS-- -3X 11 oz chambers keep liquids organized -Eliminates shower bottle clutter -Transparent bottles show how much liquid is in the chamber-Independent containers easily lift off the wall for re-filling-Integrated hooks to store loofahs, scrubs & razors-Installs easily with no tools; double-sided tape and silicone adhesive (included). Optional screw mount hardware included.-2 bonus loofahs for shower gels and soaps to help exfoliate skin & cleanse skin pores.-Water resistant --PACKAGE INCLUDES-- 1 x 3 Chamber Shampoo and conditioner Dispenser 2 x Free Bonus Loofahs 1 x Waterproof Silicone adhesive for wall mounting 1 x set of adhesive strips 1 x set of anchors and screws for optional hardware mounting 1 x set of labels (shampoo, conditioner, shower gel) 1 x Installation Manual --FAQ-- Q: Will I be able to remove the shampoo and conditioner dispenser without leaving any damage? A: When mounting with silicone, you will be able to remove the unit without leaving any damage. Q: Are the chambers removeable to clean? A: Yes. The 3 independent chambers easily slide on and off the backplate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QcTrUNRSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Banera","source_asin":"B07FPNYF99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FPNYF99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FPNYF99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
