window.products.push({"id":927849,"name":"Smores maker – Easy to Use Campfire Style Indoor S’mores Maker for Microwave – Mess-Free Dessert Machine – In-Built Water Reservoir – Sturdy Handles –","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512Rv3Q1IrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy delicious campfire s’mores at home at any time you want with our KAVKO microwave s’mores maker! No need for a campfire or any other special equipment to cook your favorite treats, simply whip out this innovative device and prepare perfect smores sandwiches! KAVKO MICROWAVE S'MORES MAKER -The s’mores maker is designed to give you just the right amount of gooey goodness with lightly toasted notes and a delightfully delectable crunch. -The in-built water reservoir absorbs all the excess radiation generated by your microwave to maintain a stable cooking temperature to prevent the marshmallows from cooking while the chocolate melts. -Featuring two sturdy to keep the contents together, the smores maker prevents sticky sugary spills in your microwave. -This S’mores maker machine is easy to use and doesn’t require any special skills to operate. -Dishwasher safe, this dessert maker is easy to clean, maintain and will last you through many s’mores making sessions. -You can use this S’mores maker to not only make your favorite marshmallow delights but also cook up innovative dessert recipes with other fillings in-between your graham crackers. -This marshmallow S’mores maker is a great gift for all dessert enthusiasts! USAGE INSTRUCTIONS -Pour water into the reservoir. -Place your graham cracker, marshmallow, and chocolate on the tray. -Put it in the microwave to heat for 30 seconds. -Change the water in the reservoir after every second time used. WE OFFER 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE! All our products are made under strict manufacturing and quality standards So, why worry? ORDER NOW to receive this handy microwave s’mores maker!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512Rv3Q1IrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kavako","source_asin":"B08Y5XYQ9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-927849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y5XYQ9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y5XYQ9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
